 abnormal heart sounds and in the lung exam document at a minimum the breath sounds and chest movement and abdominal exam at a minimum document any organomegaly tenderness texture of the abdomen and for the extremities examination documented a minimum any swelling cyanosis or clubbing and in the neuro exam document at a minimum level of alertness muscle strength and balance.  Then leave a blank line then document assessment and plan in bullet format", "result": "- Patient's Name: [Patient's Name]\n  Date of Birth: [Date of Birth]\n  Date of Visit: [Date of Visit]\n  Physician: Dr. [Physician Name]\n\n- Chief Complaint: [Chief Complaint or Reason for Visit]\n\n- Subjective:\n  [Age and Gender]: [Patient's age] years old [Male/Female]\n  [Detailed subjective information goes here]\n\n- Objective:\n  - Vital Signs:\n    - Blood Pressure: [Value]\n    - Heart Rate: [Value]\n    - Respiratory Rate: [Value]\n    - Temperature: [Value]\n    - BMI: [BMI Value] (Interpretation: [Normal/Overweight/Obese])\n\n- Detailed Physical Examination:\n  - Cardiovascular:\n    Rate: [Value]\n    Rhythm: [Value]\n    Abnormal Heart Sounds: [Description of abnormal sounds]\n\n  - Pulmonary:\n    Breath Sounds: [Description]\n    Chest Movement: [Description]\n\n  - Abdominal:\n    Organomegaly: [Presence/Absence]\n    Tenderness: [Location and severity]\n    Texture of Abdomen: [Description]\n\n  - Extremities:\n    Swelling: [Location and severity]\n    Cyanosis: [Present/Absent]\n    Clubbing: [Present/Absent]\n\n  - Neurological:\n    Level of Alertness: [Awake/Alert/Confused]\n    Muscle Strength: [Description]\n    Balance: [Description]\n\n- Assessment and Plan:\n  - [Assessment 1]\n    - [Plan for Assessment 1]\n  - [Assessment 2]\n    - [Plan for Assessment 2]\n  \n- End of Report", "created_at": "2025-01-25T23:53:50.963Z"}}, {"model": "auth_app.user", "pk": 1, "fields": {"password": "pbkdf2_sha256$870000$xTSaMIGNA35uSycsvliVC0$b75zJFCezEptGCqryu4iDx3kFXoWfjvvyOZ6zYBoW4E=", "last_